{"seq":27,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:21:38.554Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"86d840a47ec623502385a43f6d0273d1889258f3cc3082db71a9ea040ded897f","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, here are the Vantorre Group (parent, excluding Mobility) tickets I could find in the three places you asked about. Ticket numbers are listed as written in each source, and a few of them conflict.\n\n**Tickets**\n\n1. **#8841**, Vantorre Group\n   - *Moss digest 9/30* (teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-09-30-strategic-digest.md): Mateo submitted it for the Newark carrier portal, where drivers can't select Dock Door 14. Gideon escalated it to platform engineering.\n   - *Moss digest 5/4* (teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-05-04-strategic-digest.md): still open as a gate kiosk timeout at Allentown, Dock Door 12, second shift.\n   - *#strategic-pod, Jul 1, 09:17*: Gideon says he closed it with support.\n   - *Conflict:* the same number is attached to Allentown in May and Newark in September, so it may be a reused number or a mis-tagged digest entry. Please check the support system.\n\n2. **#PD-8841**, Vantorre Group\n   - *Moss digest 4/27* (teams/team-strategic/digests/2026-04-27-strategic-digest.md): two missed carrier check-ins at Allentown, Gate 4, second shift.\n   - *Possibly the same issue as #8841*, given the Allentown gate check-in theme. It's not confirmed.\n\n3. **#PD-4418**, probably Vantorre Group\n   - *Moss digest 9/15* (teams/team-strategic/digests/2025-09-15-strategic-digest.md): the `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export drops timestamps for Dock Door 9 during the 04:00 shift change. The digest says \"the account Nadia runs,\" which is the Group account by my reading of the 5/4 handoff digest. Treat the attribution as unconfirmed.\n\n4. **INC-4821**, Vantorre Group (Hartford)\n   - *#inc-vtg-hartford, Aug 3, 11:08*: Gideon says the status-page access screenshot is attached to this incident ticket.\n\n5. **VT-55120**, Vantorre Group (Hartford)\n   - *#inc-vtg-hartford, Oct 14, 09:00*: Gideon says this is the root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage, with Carrowmere's gateway route findings attached.\n\n**Not included**\n- #4812 and the Mobility EV and yard items are Mobility, so I left them out.\n- #PD-4402 is Quillfeather Outfitters, not Vantorre.\n- The 3/10/2025 digest mentions Mateo's gate check-in emails, but it has no ticket number.\n- The 8/3 digest and the 4/27 and 5/3 prep notes don't give ticket numbers for Group.\n\nSources I read: #strategic-pod (full history), #inc-vtg-hartford (full history), and the nine Moss digest files plus the cheat sheet. The cheat sheet has no ticket numbers. The brain search was keyword-only, so I relied on the channel and file reads."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
